# User Stories

## Field Service Technician (Primary)

**Goal:** Get service report digitized and find history fast.

1. As a technician, I want to fill the Incoming Service Report on my phone, so I don't have to write on paper and re-type in Excel.
2. As a technician, I want to search a Serial Number and see full repair history, so I know if this damage is repeat.
3. As a technician, I want to see all past photos/videos for a SN in one place, so I can compare old vs new damage.
4. As a technician, I want to upload 3-4 photos directly from camera, so evidence is linked instantly.
5. As a technician, I want to check my scope status (Pending/Verified/Done) without messaging QA.

**Acceptance Criteria:** Form saves as draft, SN search returns <2 sec, photos show as thumbnails with date.

## QA Lab Technician

**Goal:** Verify fast with all evidence in one view.

1. As QA, I want all incoming logs in one table with Drive links, so I can verify without asking.
2. As QA, I want outgoing log to auto-link to incoming report by SN, so traceability is clear.
3. As QA, I want to filter by Status (Pending Verification / Active Maintenance), so I can prioritize.

## Edge Cases
- No signal on lab floor → Save draft locally
- Video too large → Save Drive link instead of direct upload
- Same SN arrives twice in one week → Show warning + last repair
